  "task": {
    "title": "Image the object at twice its size",
    "description": "The object is 60 units tall and its two ends emit green and red light. Slide the two lenses, and drag the relay lens's focal point, so that both ends come to a sharp focus on the marked plane, twice as far apart as they started.",
